<title>CANADA: Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data.</title>
<headline>Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Oilseed Processors Association weekly summary of member crushing, in tonnes -</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING	  CANOLA    SOYBEANS</p>
<p>May 14		 54,783    29,963</p>
<p>change prv week   +14.6 pct  -5.2 pct</p>
<p>May 7		  47,789    31,593</p>
<p>April 30	     43,953    31,531</p>
<p>April 23	     44,966    31,510</p>
<p>April 16	     47,953    32,923</p>
<p>Aug 1 to date   2,095,057 1,169,980</p>
<p>-- Note: COPA consists of Archer Daniels Midland Co, CanAmera Foods, Canbra Foods Ltd and Northern Lite Canola Inc with crush data also provided by Cargill Ltd, the Canadian unit of Minnesota-based Cargill Inc. -- R=revised.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
